 compiler/src/evaluator.ml | 24 ++++++++++++------------
 proofs/lang/psem_core.v   |  2 +-
 proofs/lang/psem_defs.v   | 13 +++++++------
 3 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

